%% caption: Architecture
flowchart TB
    CL["Client library"] --> PROXY["Commit proxies"]
    CL --> GRV["GRV proxies · read versions"]
    PROXY --> RES["Resolvers · conflict detection"]
    RES --> TLOG["Transaction logs · durable, ordered"]
    TLOG --> SS["Storage servers"]
    SS --> CL
    CC["Cluster controller"] -.-> PROXY
    CC -.-> TLOG
    NOTE["One ordered key-value store. Everything else - SQL, documents, queues - is a layer above it"] -.-> CL
    SLOW["One slow disk on one storage server throttles the whole cluster"] -.-> SS
